"url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc11miy.jpg"}], "slug": "a-whisper-of-fall-jinyiwei", "storyline": "An ordinary boatman forced to infiltrate the elite Jinyiwei (Imperial Guards) as a black-market undercover agent. You must manage a double life, balancing official imperial duties with criminal tasks, while navigating a massive conspiracy. Using unique \"deduction\" abilities to foresee future events, the protagonist must survive in a turbulent, collapsing empire, employing stealth, rooftop traversal, and swift,,, martial arts combat.", "summary": "\"A Whisper of Fall: Jinyiwei\" is an ARPG set in the Ming Dynasty. Play as a Jinyiwei (Imperial Guard) with martial art, lightness skill and the unique deduction ability, across shifting timelines and sandbox levels to weave the destiny of yourself and the dynasty.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/a-whisper-of-fall-jinyiwei", "videos": [{"id": 166986, "name": "Announcement Trailer", "video_id": "MGPRrpfDFpU", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MGPRrpfDFpU", "title": "Project: Jinyiwei - PlayStation China Hero Project Announce Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/MGPRrpfDFpU/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 167089, "name": "Gameplay Video", "video_id": "duwJEMohExo", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=duwJEMohExo", "title": "Project: Jinyiwei - ChinaJoy 2024 Stage Event", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/duwJEMohExo/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 174846, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "PCsaYjiGs9I", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PCsaYjiGs9I", "title": "A Whisper of Fall: Jinyiwei", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/PCsaYjiGs9I/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 174856, "name": "Gameplay Trailer", "video_id": "fC182F2Ja0Y", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fC182F2Ja0Y", "title": "A Whisper Of Fall: Jinyiwei - Gameplay Trailer | PS5 Games", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/fC182F2Ja0Y/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 175481, "name": "Gameplay Trailer